# Line-ending policy.
#
# Git stores text as LF and converts on checkout. Pinning it here means a tool
# or script that rewrites a file with different endings no longer surfaces as a
# whole-file phantom diff.
#
# Everything in this repo was already LF except SUNLU_AMS_Heater_AutoVent.ino,
# which was CRLF for historical reasons. LF is verified to build clean on both
# targets (RP2040 and SAMD21), so the repo is uniformly LF.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Firmware source - explicit for clarity.
*.ino text eol=lf
*.h   text eol=lf
*.cpp text eol=lf

# Prebuilt firmware and images - never convert. The .uf2 files are tracked, so
# this matters: EOL translation would corrupt them.
*.uf2 binary
*.hex binary
*.bin binary
*.elf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
